 over's best-selling novel\, this seductive\, psychological thriller follow
 s renowned author Verity Crawford (Anne Hathaway) and Lowen Ashleigh (Dako
 ta Johnson)\, a struggling writer who relocates to the remote Crawford est
 ate to ghostwrite for Verity. After Lowen uncovers what appears to be Veri
 ty's chilling autobiographical notes\, she wrestles with the disturbing an
 d twisted confessions about Verity’s husband Jeremy (Josh Hartnett)\, an
 d finds it hard to separate fiction from reality\, manipulation from attra
 ction\, and opportunity from obsession.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/mov
 ies/verity/HO00001763\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/wes
