SUMMARY:Chronovisor
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:A French academic is seduced into a world of untold histories i
 n her scholarly quest to uncover the mystery of a history-capturing camera
